OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire, we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feelgood stories across
OL,8,Four region - and we like to shout about
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FThis week, among other stories, we are
OL,12,Ffeaturing a DIY Dalek raising money for
OL,13,Fcancer research, a teen Scout
OL,14,Fcollecting all 95 badges and an
OL,15,F87-year-old's Parkrun milestone.
OL,17,FAn 87-year-old man who completed his
OL,18,F400th Parkrun on Saturday has said he
OL,19,Fthinks running may have added years to
OL,20,Fhis life.
